[engl]
{100}{}{Junktown Guard}
{200}{}{He looks like an experienced guardsman.}
{1000}{}{[AUTO-GENERATED SKELETON: replace this entry with the NPC's initial greeting and
conditions.]}
{1010}{}{[MANUAL: initial branch condition/greeting -> JTGenGrd18]}
{2000}{}{Okay, that's enough warnings. Leave town, now, and never return, or face the
consequences!}
{2010}{}{[Done.]}
{3000}{}{You'd better put that away. Junktown is a friendly place, friend, and we want to keep it
that way.}
{3010}{}{Put what away?}
{3020}{}{Don't tell me what to do, loser boy.}
{3030}{}{Keep up the good work.}
{3040}{}{Sounds fair. By the way, what is the local law regarding weapons?}
{3050}{}{Uh,oh.}
{4000}{}{Your weapon, idiot. Killian won't take your arms away, but you'd better damn well keep
them in your holster.}
{4010}{}{Oh, sorry.}
{4020}{}{No way! I'm not putting down my shooters for nobody!}
{5000}{}{You'd better behave, since it's the law, and I enforce the law. Put your weapon away,
don't draw it unless in self-defense, and you won't have a problem with us guards.
Disobey the law, and we will return you to the lawless wasteland - dead or alive.}
{5010}{}{Sure, since you put it that way.}
{5020}{}{Bite your laws!}
{6000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'JTGenGrd01a']}
{6010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> JTGenGrd02]}
{6020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> JTGenGrd03]}
{7000}{}{Well, uh, fine with me. But you'd better be careful.}
{7010}{}{[Done.]}
{8000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'JTGenGrd00a']}
