{11000}{}{Good you asked. No weapons can be drawn except in self-defense. If you start a fight,
it's your fault. Other than that, it's your right to go around armed. Just don't pull a
knife or gun without just cause. Have a good day.}
{11010}{}{[Done.]}
{12000}{}{Hey you, no weapons! And I don't care if your momma dropped you on your head as a kid.
No weapons.}
{12010}{}{[Done.]}
{13000}{}{Hey! You! What are you doing sneaking around?}
{13010}{}{Nothing.}
{13020}{}{Uhhh.}
{13030}{}{I'm not sneaking around. I just like to walk cautiously.}
{14000}{}{Whatever you're doing, don't do it in this town.}
{14010}{}{[Done.]}
{15000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'JTGenGrd06a']}
{15010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> JTGenGrd07]}
{15020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> JTGenGrd08]}
{16000}{}{Well, uh, ok. Whatever. Just don't do anything out of line.}
{16010}{}{Thanks, bye.}
{16020}{}{Certainly. I will throw caution to the wind, sir.}
{16030}{}{Certainly. I will throw caution to the wind, ma'am.}
